sddm-authelia-passkey (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Broker: account_source=nss authorizes any NSS-resolvable account
    (local, or via SSSD against Samba AD/OpenLDAP/FreeIPA) instead of
    requiring a static allowed_users entry, gated by minimum_uid,
    deny_users, and optional allowed_groups/require_group_match. Never
    talks to LDAP/AD/SSSD directly; no directory-credential caching of
    its own. account_source=local (default) is unchanged.
  * Theme: animate the smartphone-login sidebar (slide-in/out, QR
    fade-in, per-state cross-fades, a brief "Bestätigt" checkmark beat
    before login, dimmed/labeled expired-code state, subtle waiting
    pulse, explicit hover/pressed/focus/disabled styling on the
    custom-styled alternate-code button). Purely visual; no change to
    the flow/security state machine, PAM, broker, or KWallet logic.

