sddm-authelia-passkey (0.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Harden KWallet credstore permissions and fail closed on unsafe paths.
  * Surface Authelia token-endpoint HTTP 429 state to the SDDM theme.
  * Generate the custom SDDM theme automatically from Debian Breeze plus
    the project's additive patches, without modifying the original theme.
  * Preserve KWallet credentials during rollback and extend package
    lifecycle CI for theme and credstore regressions.

  * Keep cancellation, expiry, throttling, and infrastructure failures out
    of the local auth-failure lockout; make rate-limit waits interruptible.
  * Preserve unrelated SDDM configuration and dpkg ownership during rollback.

  * Make repeated PAM setup a true no-op before backup creation and make
    automatic rollback select only clean pre-integration PAM backups.

